+* On macOS, --enable-codesign=CERT now signs GDB with the Hardened Runtime and
+  the com.apple.security.cs.debugger entitlement.  To debug an inferior
+  through the native Darwin target, the inferior must also be signed with the
+  com.apple.security.get-task-allow entitlement.  A plain executable
+  produced by /usr/bin/cc -g does not carry that entitlement.
